      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.826 - Muhammad ibn Muslim asked Imam Muhammad ibn Ali Al-Baqir (as) about a man praying without taking his hands out of his garment.\nThe Imam said: \"If he takes his hands out, it is good, but if he does not, there is no issue (no problem).\""
        ]
